- **Exclusive Official Distributor**: Witt Kung retains the **EXCLUSIVE worldwide right** to publish and distribute pre-compiled binaries and official application builds on the Apple Mac App Store, Homebrew Tap (`wittkung/tap`), and official channels.
- **Enterprise Commercial License**: Commercial entities wishing to integrate `ttzip` into proprietary commercial products, paid services, or enterprise-wide automated production environments must obtain a paid **Commercial Enterprise License** from the author (Contact: `witt.w.kung@gmail.com`).

